# Force LF for all text files checked into the repo. The .md files
# in `doc/` were accidentally committed with CRLF terminators on
# Windows during a P7 commit cycle; we normalize the rest of the
# repo to LF and add this guard so future re-introductions of CRLF
# get caught by `git diff --check` (or by a CI hook) before they
# land.
* text=auto eol=lf
